# Panels and their pages (decisions 009, 165, 170): always-available entries
# that aren't live until started, each a card reached by its icon in the page
# row. There is no Home: the idle pill opens the first page's card.

scenario: clicking idle opens the first page's card
panel focus                         -> Idle
panel notes
click                               -> Expanded expanded=focus
click                               -> Idle                     # a card closes on a click, as any does

scenario: nothing with a card, nothing to open
click                               -> Idle
panel battery static                -> Idle
click                               -> Idle
panel settings button               -> Idle                     # a page-row button isn't a page (decision 113)
click                               -> Idle
open-island                         -> Idle
panel focus
click                               -> Expanded expanded=focus  # the first with a card, past the others

scenario: a panel never takes the pill or the bubble
panel focus
panel battery
start media                         -> Compact top=media

scenario: a dormant card closes like any Expanded view
panel focus
click                               -> Expanded expanded=focus
esc                                 -> Idle
click
outside                             -> Idle
click
wait 7999                           -> Expanded
wait 1                              -> Idle

scenario: compact still opens the top activity, a dormant page is an icon away
panel focus
start media
click                               -> Expanded expanded=media
switch focus                        -> Expanded expanded=focus top=media
switch media                        -> Expanded expanded=media

scenario: a panel with no card opens nothing
panel battery static
panel focus
click
card battery                        -> Expanded expanded=focus
switch battery                      -> Expanded expanded=focus

scenario: starting from the card shows the live card, stopping shows the dormant one
panel focus
click
start focus                         -> Expanded expanded=focus top=focus
end focus                           -> Expanded expanded=focus top=none

scenario: a running panel's card opened by name makes it the pick
panel focus
start focus
start media                         -> top=media
click                               -> expanded=media
card focus                          -> Expanded expanded=focus pinned=focus top=focus

scenario: removing a panel closes its dormant card
panel focus
click
unpanel focus                       -> Idle

scenario: republishing a panel keeps its card open
panel focus
click
panel focus                         -> Expanded expanded=focus

scenario: alerts wait while a card is open
panel focus
click
alert copied                        -> Expanded queue=1
esc                                 -> Alert alert=copied

scenario: a card that keeps open stays on a click between its controls (decision 030)
panel settings keep
click                               -> Expanded expanded=settings
click                               -> Expanded expanded=settings
esc                                 -> Idle
click
outside                             -> Idle
click
wait 8000                           -> Idle

scenario: a card with no idle timeout stays when left alone, still closes on Esc or outside (decision 062)
panel focus awake
click                               -> Expanded expanded=focus
wait 60000                          -> Expanded expanded=focus
outside                             -> Idle
click
start focus awake                   -> Expanded expanded=focus top=focus
wait 60000                          -> Expanded expanded=focus
esc                                 -> Compact

scenario: a press on empty space squashes only where the click would close something (decision 071)
panel settings keep
start media                         -> Compact squash=yes
click                               -> Expanded expanded=media squash=yes
switch settings                     -> Expanded expanded=settings squash=no

scenario: the island's shortcut (Ctrl+Q) opens the default page from anywhere (decisions 032, 170)
panel focus
open-island                         -> Expanded expanded=focus  # nothing running: the first page
open-island                         -> Expanded expanded=focus  # open already: reduce leaves it (the app sends Esc instead)
esc                                 -> Idle
start media
open-island                         -> Expanded expanded=media  # something running: the pill's activity
switch focus                        -> Expanded expanded=focus
open-island                         -> Expanded expanded=focus
esc                                 -> Compact

scenario: Esc closes, however the card was reached (decisions 033, 170)
panel focus
start media
click                               -> Expanded expanded=media
esc                                 -> Compact
card focus                          -> Expanded expanded=focus
esc                                 -> Compact
click
switch focus                        -> Expanded expanded=focus
esc                                 -> Compact
alert copied
click                               -> Expanded expanded=media
esc                                 -> Compact

scenario: a provider closes its own card when it's done (search, decision 079)
panel search
card search                         -> Expanded expanded=search
close-card other                    -> Expanded expanded=search   # someone else's: nothing
close-card search                   -> Idle
card search
pin                                 -> Expanded stay=yes
close-card search                   -> Expanded expanded=search   # pinned: it stays (decision 046)

scenario: a page-row button's card opens by name, and isn't the default page
panel search button
panel focus
click                               -> Expanded expanded=focus

scenario: a page-row icon opens a dormant panel's card (decision 165)
panel timer
panel theme static
start media
switch timer                        -> Compact                  # not open: an icon is only on the card
click                               -> Expanded expanded=media
switch timer                        -> Expanded expanded=timer top=media   # dormant: its card, the pill's pick unchanged
switch theme                        -> Expanded expanded=timer  # no card to show
switch media                        -> Expanded expanded=media pinned=media
esc                                 -> Compact top=media
